Error [E2305]: This view points into `items`, which this function owns
  --> tests/ui/nested_payload_view_escape.jet:8:46
    |
  8 |     if packet == .Data(items) -> return items[0..1]
    |                                              ^^^^^^
 Why: `items` is made here and freed when the function returns, so a read window into it would outlive what owns it — there'd be nothing left to look at
 Fix: Return an owned copy with `~place` (for example `~value[a..b]`), or accept the source as a parameter so the caller keeps owning it
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E2305
